@startuml b-seq-failover
title Вариант B. Failover: push не подтверждён → SMS (провайдер A недоступен → провайдер B)
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "Temporal\nServer" as T
participant "Delivery Worker\n(workflow)" as WF
participant "Delivery Worker\n(activities)" as WA
participant "SMS-\nпровайдер A" as SA
participant "SMS-\nпровайдер B" as SB
participant "Receipt\nGateway" as RG
actor "Мобильное\nприложение" as APP
queue "Kafka" as K

note over T, WF: Исходно: activity SendPush завершена, workflow ждёт\nSignal("receipt") или Timer(10 с). Сигнала нет

== Через 10 с: таймер сработал ==
T -> T: TimerFired (переживает рестарт воркеров:\nтаймер хранится в Cassandra)
T -> WF: workflow task
WF -> T: ScheduleActivity SendSms(attempt #2)\nRetryPolicy: 3 попытки, backoff 1 с → 2 с
T -> WA: activity task

== Отказ провайдера внутри канала ==
WA -> SA: submit(phone, text, client_ref = attempt #2)
SA --> WA: 503 / таймаут 2 с
WA -> WA: circuit breaker A: ошибка учтена,\nмаршрут → провайдер B
WA -> SB: submit(phone, text, client_ref = attempt #2)
SB --> WA: accepted {provider_msg_id}
WA -> T: ActivityTaskCompleted(provider = B)
T -> WF: workflow task
WF -> T: await Signal("receipt", attempt #2) ИЛИ Timer(90 с)

== Подтверждение доставки SMS ==
SB -> RG: DLR webhook {provider_msg_id, DELIVERED}
RG -> T: SignalWorkflow(workflow_id, receipt{sms, attempt #2})
T -> WF: workflow task
WF -> T: ScheduleActivity PublishStatus
T -> WA: activity task
WA -> K: notif.status: DELIVERED {channel = sms, failover = true}
WF -> T: CompleteWorkflow(DELIVERED)

== Запоздавший ACK по push ==
APP -> RG: POST /receipts {attempt #1}
RG -> T: SignalWorkflow(workflow_id, receipt{push})
T --> RG: ошибка: workflow уже завершён
RG -> RG: метрика late_receipt / cross_channel_duplicate

alt DLR = FAILED или нет сигнала за 90 с
  WF -> T: ScheduleActivity SendEmail (попытка #3, ожидание 180 с)
else каналы исчерпаны или WorkflowRunTimeout = 5 мин
  WF -> T: PublishStatus FAILED → CompleteWorkflow(FAILED) → алерт
end
@enduml
